  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Piloting Online School Content</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Titik Pintar provides personalized practice material for children on primary school in Indonesia. Using the government curriculum as a base and adding content from multiple curricula, the full spectrum of what children need to learn will be provided. During the DGGF-TA project Titik Pintar further developed content for the app and piloted at 6 different schools. Training teachers in the use of the app and providing freelance jobs related to content creation, marketing, training and data analysis. During the pilot, the focus has been put in Science and Mathematics as courses to educate primary school children. During the project, 20 FTE were supported and 40 people were trained.</narrative>
  </description>
